      <div class="view-content">
          <div class="views-row"><div><span class="field--label">Contatti</span><div class="field--type-text-long"><ul><li>Didactic Secretariat of the Faculty of Agricultural and Food Sciences<br>via Celoria 2 - 20133 Milano<br><a href="https://informastudenti.unimi.it/saw/ess?AUTH=SAML" title="Apri la pagina in una nuova finestra" onclick="window.open(this.href);return false">https://informastudenti.unimi.it/saw/ess?AUTH=SAML</a><br><a href="tel:+390250316511">+390250316511</a><br>Public opening hours: Monday from 10 am to 12 am and from 2 pm to 4 pm</li><li>Student registrar<br>via Celoria 18 - 20133 Milano<br><a href="https://www.unimi.it/en/node/360" title="Apri la pagina in una nuova finestra" onclick="window.open(this.href);return false">https://www.unimi.it/en/node/360</a><br><a href="tel:+390250325032">+390250325032</a><br><a href="https://www.unimi.it/en/node/359">https://www.unimi.it/en/node/359</a></li><li>Head of MERGED Commission (International Management Commission of the Study Programme which coordinates with the local commissions, for Italy the "Collegio didattico")<br>prof. Carsten Smith-Hall</li><li>International web site of the Master Degree Course<br><a href="https://merged.info" title="Apri la pagina in una nuova finestra" onclick="window.open(this.href);return false">https://merged.info</a></li><li>Representative for disability services and specific learning disabilities<br>prof. Giulio Senes</li></ul></div></div></div>

